{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lemonade Apocalypse 2: The Great Filter</strong> is an incremental lemonade stand game with deckbuilding elements. Explore 27 different gameplay combinations and endings with the story based Prestige mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: The trailer is outdated, unfortunately. As new graphics are needed for a new one<strong>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(We need to enter alpha of v2.0 first)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/84e74e3251e39e2b14d5a5b1703cada2.avif?t=1765534724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras_big/84e74e3251e39e2b14d5a5b1703cada2.avif?t=1765534724 width=1560 height=570 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A PLETHORA OF INGREDIENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and gather ingredients with unique properties that affect the final lemonade mix. Increase demand and boost sales by minmaxing ingredients!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POLLUTE YOUR WAY TO SALES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingredients pollute, which is great! That leads to global warming and thirstier customers!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AFFECT POLITICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingredients sourced from certain areas affect politics, and could help you gain power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/f08b494b90e261d284f2148567932075.avif?t=1765534724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras_big/f08b494b90e261d284f2148567932075.avif?t=1765534724 width=1560 height=570 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUPPLY &amp; DEMAND SIM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core is the supply and demand mechanic. Use dubious means to manipulate demand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/11ec967487b45e3afe8e7e43a5d1387c.poster.avif?t=1765534724\" width=606 height=187 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/11ec967487b45e3afe8e7e43a5d1387c.webm?t=1765534724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVOLVING GAMEPLAY OVER 3 CHAPTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradually unlock new properties for ingredients, as well as new mini games!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE CUSTOM RECIPES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 50 different ingredients, your minmaxing needs will be quenched!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fruits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweeteners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE A FACTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the lemonade production with employees - and look out for unions! In the first chapter you make one lemonade at a time but this scene features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple production lines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bulk sales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World wide sales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Union squashing (if you want)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/bf443fe810175fe2b50988d9fdab76ce.avif?t=1765534724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras_big/bf443fe810175fe2b50988d9fdab76ce.webp?t=1765534724 width=1560 height=887 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORLD DOMINATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get involved in politics once you reach enough influence:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the training of AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear down rainforests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure no pro-climate laws are passed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because people drink more when it's hot outside!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/03107b7403cd995704bb6f2576e51a47.avif?t=1765534724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras_big/03107b7403cd995704bb6f2576e51a47.webp?t=1765534724 width=1560 height=887 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NUMBERS GO UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an incremental game. Expect to become filthy rich, and the worlds first trillionaire... and beyond.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HANDDRAWN ART</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All art is drawn by hand with a unique style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story driven incremental clicker with deckbuilding-like gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom recipes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 ingredients with unique properties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige when you finish the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supply &amp; demand sim</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay that evolves with your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >27 different story endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple mini-games</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3427820?t=1765534724","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/a8259d3e64c8a78cb39ef4dfa0a0c8c871274e5e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765534724","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/bf4cb278142c03cbbb69ccc3179c1837ba43bed4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765534724","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/bf4cb278142c03cbbb69ccc3179c1837ba43bed4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765534724","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3539910,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lemonade Apocalypse 2: The Great Filter</strong> is an incremental lemonade stand game with deckbuilding elements. Explore 27 different gameplay combinations and endings with the story based Prestige mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: The trailer is outdated, unfortunately. As new graphics are needed for a new one<strong>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(We need to enter alpha of v2.0 first)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/84e74e3251e39e2b14d5a5b1703cada2.avif?t=1765534724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras_big/84e74e3251e39e2b14d5a5b1703cada2.avif?t=1765534724 width=1560 height=570 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A PLETHORA OF INGREDIENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and gather ingredients with unique properties that affect the final lemonade mix. Increase demand and boost sales by minmaxing ingredients!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POLLUTE YOUR WAY TO SALES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingredients pollute, which is great! That leads to global warming and thirstier customers!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AFFECT POLITICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingredients sourced from certain areas affect politics, and could help you gain power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/f08b494b90e261d284f2148567932075.avif?t=1765534724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras_big/f08b494b90e261d284f2148567932075.avif?t=1765534724 width=1560 height=570 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUPPLY &amp; DEMAND SIM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core is the supply and demand mechanic. Use dubious means to manipulate demand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/11ec967487b45e3afe8e7e43a5d1387c.poster.avif?t=1765534724\" width=606 height=187 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/11ec967487b45e3afe8e7e43a5d1387c.webm?t=1765534724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVOLVING GAMEPLAY OVER 3 CHAPTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradually unlock new properties for ingredients, as well as new mini games!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE CUSTOM RECIPES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 50 different ingredients, your minmaxing needs will be quenched!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fruits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweeteners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE A FACTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the lemonade production with employees - and look out for unions! In the first chapter you make one lemonade at a time but this scene features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple production lines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bulk sales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World wide sales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Union squashing (if you want)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/bf443fe810175fe2b50988d9fdab76ce.avif?t=1765534724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras_big/bf443fe810175fe2b50988d9fdab76ce.webp?t=1765534724 width=1560 height=887 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORLD DOMINATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get involved in politics once you reach enough influence:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the training of AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear down rainforests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure no pro-climate laws are passed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because people drink more when it's hot outside!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras/03107b7403cd995704bb6f2576e51a47.avif?t=1765534724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/extras_big/03107b7403cd995704bb6f2576e51a47.webp?t=1765534724 width=1560 height=887 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NUMBERS GO UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an incremental game. Expect to become filthy rich, and the worlds first trillionaire... and beyond.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HANDDRAWN ART</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All art is drawn by hand with a unique style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story driven incremental clicker with deckbuilding-like gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom recipes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 ingredients with unique properties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige when you finish the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supply &amp; demand sim</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay that evolves with your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >27 different story endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple mini-games</p></li></ul>","developers":["Adventales"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427820/d95db2bd265a75bcd2d7d3ae049035cad8d37521/header.jpg?t=1765534724","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Catalina<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Both<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3427820/1826233470/d0fea33890e7fad8ae035cf728c17da6e5fa7bb6/1750849999/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747944668","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3427820/1826233470/d0fea33890e7fad8ae035cf728c17da6e5fa7bb6/1750849999/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747944668","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3427820/1826233470/d0fea33890e7fad8ae035cf728c17da6e5fa7bb6/1750849999/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747944668","id":257143777,"name":"CHAPTER 1 TRAILER","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257143777/464b4d6c66f52edab73d4bd31caf06b92b3c3527/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747944668"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3427820/829339/e5a97e8f19